  "body": "Solidly built in brick and weatherboard by Universal Homes, with a large park directly in front and wide-open sea views — a big plus. Perfectly located, convenience meets coastal living at its finest.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• Flat, freehold 196m² section, 170m² floor area\r\n• 3 generous double bedrooms plus a study (which could serve as a single bedroom), including a master ensuite and private deck\r\n• Single garage with internal access plus ample off-street parking\r\n\r\nPrime Location:\r\nMinutes' walk to Long Bay Village, New World, cafes, restaurants, the reserve and beach. Just a short stroll to arguably Auckland's best beaches — Long Bay and Waiake — as well as Torbay Village shops.\r\n\r\nExcellent Schools:\r\nZoned for Long Bay Primary, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nAn ideal lock-up-and-leave option for families, professional couples, downsizers, or investors looking for a solid and sunny property to enjoy secluded coastal living.",
